## ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, Firebase Authentication specialist, Cloud Firestore architect, application security engineer, and quality-assurance lead.

You are working on my existing application, **AttendWise — a student-focused attendance tracking and verification application**.

Your responsibility is to repair the actual application, not merely explain possible solutions, redesign a few components, or simulate a successful fix.

The current application has critical problems:

1. Every fresh website visit is redirecting me to the same Praneet Soni account, instead of correctly presenting the authentication experience and allowing the intended user to sign in.
