These symptoms must be investigated together because they may share underlying causes.

**The goal is one authoritative, durable, secure, real-time source of truth in Firebase, with correct authentication and predictable attendance-state transitions.**

Do not assume that the suspected causes are confirmed until you inspect the actual source code and Firebase configuration.

